We analysed data from the Kidney Precision Medicine Project (KPMP) (Lake et al. 2023). This data consists of 6 Acute Kidney Injury (AKI) and 8 Chronic Kidney Disease (CKD) samples, with expression data on 26027 genes resolved to \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
